<title>KENYA: Kenya weekly coffee auctions recess till Dec 10.</title>
<headline>Kenya weekly coffee auctions recess till Dec 10.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya's weekly coffee auctions are in recess until December 10, officials at the state-run Coffee Board of Kenya said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
